{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/extras/589485f54aa9229062079991ee3543d2.avif?t=1768284138\" width=562 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Field Notes</strong> is a sci-fi exploration game where you play as a curious alien researcher on a mission to document life across our solar system. From the lush wilderness of Earth to the mysterious biomes of distant planets, you'll collect samples, snap photos, and uncover fascinating facts about unique wildlife. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover strange species, catalog your findings, and piece together the wonders of life in this charming blend of science, adventure, and interstellar curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/extras/9fa2ff0a8997e277c503c410a60342ce.avif?t=1768284138\" width=795 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the narrative adventure of an up-and-coming researcher.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to Earth and other celestial bodies to observe, photograph and study a wide variety of wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take and save photos of your favorite moments and creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious Flora and Fauna and catalogue them in your Notebook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch water-based creatures for study with your Fishing Rod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a variety of friendly pets that will help you find hidden items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect ancient artifacts to discover local history and ancient mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of colorful characters, who may have information vital to your research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit some special creatures to aid you in your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance of your character with a variety of options to make your journey your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806480?t=1768284138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806480?t=1768284138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/1d414ad9ac74619dfe2de0360be72ee2dc0d50a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768284138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/1d414ad9ac74619dfe2de0360be72ee2dc0d50a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768284138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/extras/589485f54aa9229062079991ee3543d2.avif?t=1768284138\" width=562 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Field Notes</strong> is a sci-fi exploration game where you play as a curious alien researcher on a mission to document life across our solar system. From the lush wilderness of Earth to the mysterious biomes of distant planets, you'll collect samples, snap photos, and uncover fascinating facts about unique wildlife. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover strange species, catalog your findings, and piece together the wonders of life in this charming blend of science, adventure, and interstellar curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806480/extras/9fa2ff0a8997e277c503c410a60342ce.avif?t=1768284138\" width=795 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the narrative adventure of an up-and-coming researcher.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to Earth and other celestial bodies to observe, photograph and study a wide variety of wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take and save photos of your favorite moments and creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious Flora and Fauna and catalogue them in your Notebook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch water-based creatures for study with your Fishing Rod.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a variety of friendly pets that will help you find hidden items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect ancient artifacts to discover local history and ancient mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of colorful characters, who may have information vital to your research.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit some special creatures to aid you in your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance of your character with a variety of options to make your journey your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Iron Harbor Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descript